### GET User Library Books
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/library
Cookie: accessToken={{accessToken}}

### Get User Library Book by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/library/e1974c5b-0c3c-4d4a-a2aa-0beba43ae242
Cookie: accessToken={{accessToken}}

### POST Add Book to User Library
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/library/796c0d98-dd21-4ed5-82b8-f59e2a7cf750
Cookie: accessToken={{accessToken}}

### PATCH Change Reading Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/library/796c0d98-dd21-4ed5-82b8-f59e2a7cf750
Cookie: accessToken={{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reading_status": "lu"
}

### DELETE Remove Book from User Library
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/library/796c0d98-dd21-4ed5-82b8-f59e2a7cf750
Cookie: accessToken={{accessToken}}

### PATCH Update Book Rating
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/library/e1974c5b-0c3c-4d4a-a2aa-0beba43ae242/rating
Cookie: accessToken={{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 4
}